    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="i1_lead">A bare name is a Phosphor icon, filled by default. Add a weight after a colon: thin, light, regular, bold, fill or duotone. The second argument is the class list, so size and colour are ordinary utilities.</p>
  </div>
