    <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-base-content/70" data-sw-text="i3_lead">The <code class="font-code text-base">brand:</code> prefix draws a logo from the Simple Icons set, the right shape for a row of social links. A bare brand name such as <code class="font-code text-base">github</code> draws Phosphor's own logo instead, which takes a weight and sits well inline with text. Note that <code class="font-code text-base">x</code> is the close glyph and <code class="font-code text-base">brand:x</code> is the logo.</p>
